    },
    {
      "displayText": "最棒的禮物",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670068D2768479AE72690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "朱紅色的傳說",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67317D058272768450B38AAA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "靛藍色的傳說",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "975B85CD8272768450B38AAA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "追趕安馨兒時誤闖的\n奇妙空間究竟是什麼……？\n就在此時收到了烏羽的召喚。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FFD8D955B8999A8515266428AA495D67684000A594759997A7A95937A767ADF662F4EC09EBC20262026FF1F000A5C3157286B646642653652304E8670CF7FBD768453EC559A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "「異次元密阿雷」的調查\n將與鏽蝕組一同合作。\n安馨兒身邊的寶可夢，\n胡帕牠的能力似乎會成為關鍵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "300C75706B2151435BC6963F96F7300D76848ABF67E5000A5C07820793FD87557D444E00540C54084F5C3002000A5B8999A851528EAB908A76845BF653EF5922FF0C000A80E15E157260768480FD529B4F3C4E4E6703621070BA95DC937530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "悠閒的早晨時光\n隨著激烈的門扉聲戛然而止……！\n看來必須讓激動得昏頭的\n春紫冷靜下來。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A09592768465E9666866425149000A96A884576FC070C87684958062498072621B7136800C6B6220262026FF01000A770B4F865FC598088B936FC052D55F97660F982D7684000A66257D2B51B7975C4E0B4F8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "安馨兒和可爾妮的加入，\n讓旅館Z熱鬧了起來。\n異次元密阿雷的調查\n似乎還會持續好一段時間。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8999A85152548C53EF723E59AE768452A05165FF0C000A8B9365C59928005A71B19B274E868D774F863002000A75706B2151435BC6963F96F776848ABF67E5000A4F3C4E4E9084670363017E8C597D4E006BB56642959330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "異次元密阿雷的調查短暫停歇。\n在等候烏羽聯絡的同時，\n將陪著安馨兒和可爾妮\n展開密阿雷觀光之旅。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75706B2151435BC6963F96F776848ABF67E577ED66AB505C6B473002000A57287B49501970CF7FBD806F7D617684540C6642FF0C000A5C07966A84575B8999A85152548C53EF723E59AE000A5C55958B5BC6963F96F789C051494E4B65C530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "應該誰都不在裡面的作戰會議室，\n突然傳來了可疑的聲響……\n莫非有誰躲在裡面？\n慎重地確認一下房間裡面吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "61C98A728AB090FD4E0D572888E1976276844F5C623067038B705BA4FF0C000A7A81713650B34F864E8653EF75917684807297FF20262026000A83AB975E67098AB08EB2572888E19762FF1F000A614E91CD573078BA8A8D4E004E0B623F959388E19762542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "異次元密阿雷的調查一步步地在前進。\n發現扭洞的精準度逐漸提高，\n開始能夠調查更高級別的\n異次元密阿雷了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75706B2151435BC6963F96F776848ABF67E54E006B656B6557305728524D90323002000A767C73FE626D6D1E76847CBE6E965EA690106F3863D09AD8FF0C000A958B59CB80FD59208ABF67E566F49AD87D1A52257684000A75706B2151435BC6963F96F74E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即使早餐的時間過了，也絲毫\n沒有琵魯要從房間出來的氣息。\n頭巾混混似乎是來傳達什麼事情，\n到房間去看看情況吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734F7F65E99910768466429593904E4E86FF0C4E5F7D726BEB000A6C92670974359B6F89815F9E623F959351FA4F8676846C23606F3002000A982D5DFE6DF76DF74F3C4E4E662F4F8650B390544EC09EBC4E8B60C5FF0C000A5230623F959353BB770B770B60C56CC1542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "稜鏡塔上空的巨大扭洞\n似乎逐漸地擴大帶來的影響。\n在危險波及密阿雷之前，\n必須解開異次元的謎題。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A1C93E158544E0A7A7A76845DE85927626D6D1E000A4F3C4E4E90106F38573064F459275E364F8676845F7197FF3002000A5728537196AA6CE253CA5BC6963F96F74E4B524DFF0C000A5FC5980889E3958B75706B21514376848B0E984C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "據說密阿雷市可能會被\n異次元密阿雷給吞沒。\n究竟是否有方法能夠阻止\n異次元密阿雷不斷地膨脹呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64DA8AAA5BC6963F96F75E0253EF80FD670388AB000A75706B2151435BC6963F96F77D66541E6C923002000A7A767ADF662F5426670965B96CD580FD5920963B6B62000A75706B2151435BC6963F96F74E0D65B7573081A881395462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正當準備入睡時，\n玳蘿的聲音響徹了旅館Z！\n發生了什麼麻煩嗎……？\n總之趕緊確認狀況！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B6375766E965099516577616642FF0C000A73B3863F7684807297F397FF5FB94E8665C59928005AFF01000A767C751F4E864EC09EBC9EBB716955CE20262026FF1F000A7E3D4E4B8D957DCA78BA8A8D72C06CC1FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "根據目前為止收集的資料，\n分析似乎有了很大的進展。\n解開異次元密阿雷之謎，\n阻止現實與異次元的融合吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "683964DA76EE524D70BA6B62653696C676848CC76599FF0C000A520667904F3C4E4E67094E865F885927768490325C553002000A89E3958B75706B2151435BC6963F96F74E4B8B0EFF0C000A963B6B6273FE5BE6820775706B2151437684878D5408542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "異次元的謎題雖然解開了，\n但安馨兒原本的目的，\n也就是傳說的寶可夢還沒能找到。\n看來還需要持續的調查。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75706B21514376848B0E984C96D6713689E3958B4E86FF0C000A4F465B8999A85152539F672C768476EE7684FF0C000A4E5F5C31662F50B38AAA76845BF653EF592290846C9280FD627E52303002000A770B4F8690849700898163017E8C76848ABF67E530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "翠綠色的巨大扭洞出現了。\n這個扭洞似乎通向安馨兒追尋的\n傳說的寶可夢烈空坐所在之處。\n準備好甜甜圈去捕捉牠吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7FE07DA0827276845DE85927626D6D1E51FA73FE4E863002000A9019500B626D6D1E4F3C4E4E901A54115B8999A851528FFD5C0B7684000A50B38AAA76845BF653EF592270C87A7A5750624057284E4B86553002000A6E965099597D751C751C570853BB6355634972605427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "朱紅色扭洞的深處\n探測到了固拉多的存在。\n用特製食譜製作甜甜圈，\n去捕捉固拉多吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67317D058272626D6D1E76846DF18655000A63A26E2C52304E8656FA62C9591A76845B5857283002000A7528727988FD98DF8B5C88FD4F5C751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB6355634956FA62C9591A5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "靛藍色扭洞的深處\n探測到了蓋歐卡的存在。\n用特製食譜製作甜甜圈，\n去捕捉蓋歐卡吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "975B85CD8272626D6D1E76846DF18655000A63A26E2C52304E8684CB6B50536176845B5857283002000A7528727988FD98DF8B5C88FD4F5C751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB6355634984CB6B5053615427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "應烏羽的召喚，\n前往鏽蝕組的事務所。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "61C970CF7FBD768453EC559AFF0C000A524D5F8093FD87557D4476844E8B52D9624030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好甜甜圈，\n去調查異次元扭洞。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB8ABF67E575706B215143626D6D1E30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好甜甜圈，\n去調查異次元扭洞。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB8ABF67E575706B215143626D6D1E30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好甜甜圈，\n去調查異次元密阿雷。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB8ABF67E575706B2151435BC6963F96F730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "前往鏽蝕組的事務所\n聽取分析結果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "524D5F8093FD87557D4476844E8B52D96240000A807D53D6520667907D50679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "使用超級進化\n戰勝可爾妮。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F7F75288D857D1A90325316000A623052DD53EF723E59AE30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好異次元樹果\n作為材料的高級別甜甜圈，\n挑戰危險的異次元。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D75706B2151436A39679C000A4F5C70BA6750659976849AD87D1A5225751C751C5708FF0C000A63116230537196AA768475706B21514330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出現了失控超級進化的反應。\n捕捉阿勃梭魯。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA73FE4E86593163A78D857D1A90325316768453CD61C93002000A63556349963F52C368AD9B6F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用寶可夢的招式\n擊中獎勵球。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75285BF653EF5922768462DB5F0F000A64CA4E2D734E52F5740330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
